# Dev-mode defaults (`npm run dev` / `vite`). Loaded only in development — a production
# build gets none of this, so a bundle shipped without VITE_FORMS_API_ORIGIN fails loudly
# instead of silently running the serverless fixture (ticket 153).
#
# To run against a live local node, set VITE_FORMS_API_ORIGIN (see vite.config.ts — the
# dev server proxies /api/local-node to it); an origin takes precedence over the fixture.
# Accepted opt-in values: exactly "1" or "true" (mirroring Blazor's FormsAdmin:UseFixture=true).
VITE_FORMS_FIXTURE=1
